- Reading GS states from WFK file: t16o_DS3_WFK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------


---------------------------------------------------------------

  Calculation of overlap and call to wannier90 library 
  to obtain maximally localized wannier functions 

  - t16o_DS4_w90.win is a mandatory secondary input
  - t16o_DS4_w90.wout is the output for the library
  - t16o_DS4_w90random.amn contains random projections
  - t16o_DS4_w90.amn contains projections
  - t16o_DS4_w90.mmn contains the overlap
  - t16o_DS4_w90.eig contains the eigenvalues

---------------------------------------------------------------

   mlwfovlp :  mlwfovlp_setup done -
-  see t16o_DS4_w90.wout for details.

